        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/boyer-museum-wildwood/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Founded in 1963, the Wildwood Historical Society became the custodian of George F. Boyer's collection.",
